    81	X7-SC evaluation and doubling, 0.3 h preparation and tail) = 1.99 USD at 0.56 USD per hour. Estimate 1.99 USD;
    82	reservation 2.49 USD (x 1.25) in the ledger category `followup` (cap 22 USD shared by all follow-up runs;
    83	`docs/revision/followup/budget_followup.py reserve`); **stop cap 3.00 USD**, failed attempts counted. The driver checks
    84	the cap between stages (`--cap-usd 3.00 --started-at <allocation time>`): a stage starts only if the billed time so far
    85	plus its estimate stays within the cap; a running stage is never killed (author's instruction); the run stops, writes
    86	`cost_stop.json` and an inventory, and reports.
    87	
    88	## 6. Steps
    89	
    90	1. Internal review to consensus; freeze this plan.
    91	2. Reserve in the ledger; one pod: the reset reproduction gate, then `runnerup_v2.py --stage all --workers 12 --evidence
    92	   ... --cap-usd 3.00 --started-at T`; delete and verify the pod; record the spend.
    93	3. Analysis on the Mac from the retrieved records; a paper paragraph and table labelled exploratory, after review.

